_:c14n5 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "\"Each course description is a beautiful, double-page spread (some are 4 pages), with a history of its design, construction and great rounds played; the highlights of playing there now, a locator map, length and par play, and green fees for the course -- because these are courses we dream of playing, not just looking at!\"-- Provided by publisher."@en .
